{"id":"word:hebrew:H6999","type":"word","title":"קָטַר","subtitle":"H6999 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"to smoke , i.e. turn into fragrance by fire (especially as an act of worship)","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to קָטַר (H6999) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: v n-m n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 117 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"קָטַר (qâṭar) means to smoke , i.e. turn into fragrance by fire (especially as an act of worship) First listed occurrence: 1Chr 6 34."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"קָטַר","transliteration":"qâṭar","pronunciation":"kaw-tar'","strong":"H6999","lemmaId":"hebrew:H6999","partOfSpeech":"v n-m n-f","forms":["וּֽ/מְקַטְּרִ֖ים","וְ/הִקְטִ֨יר","וַ/יַּקְטֵ֥ר","לְ/הַקְטִ֥יר","וְ/הִקְטִ֣יר"],"morphs":[["HC/Vhq3ms",17],["HR/Vhc",12],["HC/Vhw3ms",10],["HR/Vpc",8],["HC/Vprmpa",6],["HC/Vpw3mp",5],["HVpp3cp",4],["HC/Vhrmsa",3],["HC/Vpw3ms",3],["HVprmpa",3]]},"definitions":{"short":"to smoke , i.e. turn into fragrance by fire (especially as an act of worship)","usage":"burn (incense, sacrifice) (upon), (altar for) incense, kindle, offer (incense, a sacrifice).","full":"H6999. qatar [ קָטַר ] 115 verb denominative Pi`el Hiph`il make sacrifices smoke, send them up in smoke (properly produce קְטֹרֶת , see Sta ZAW vi (1886), 298 f. ); — Pi`el 42 Perfect 3masculine plural קִטְּרוּ Jer 19:13 +, קִטַּרְתֶּם 44:21 , 23 ; Imperfect 3masculine singular יְקַטֵּר Hab 1:16 +; 3 masculine plural יְקַטֵּר֑וּן Hosea 11:2 , etc.; Infinitive absolute קַטֵּר 1Sam 2:16 +; construct Jer 11:13 +, Participle plural מְקַטְּרִים Isa 65:3 +, etc.; — make sacrifices smoke , offer them by burning : to ׳י , 1Sam 2:16 (where probably read יְקַטְּרוּן [and so 2:15 ] Sta l.c. 299 ): elsewhere to other gods or in illegal worship, Jer 44:23 ; with accusative קִטֵּר (but see this, below) 44:21 (here [and al. in some other passages] of incense ), תּוֺדָה Amos 4:5 ; place is usually with ב , e.g. כַּבָּמוֺת 2Kin 17:11 ; 23:5 ; בַּבָּמוֺת וּמְקַטְּרִים מְוַבְּחִים הָעָם עוֺד 1Kin 22:44 ; 2Kin 12:4 ; 14:4 ; 15:4 , 35 (R), compare 16:4 2Chr 28:4 (compare RS Sem.i. 471; 2nd ed. 490 ); שָׁמָּה קִטְּרוּ ׳הַבּ אֲשֶׁר 2Kin 23:8 ; with עַל e.g. הגבעות על Hosea 4:13 , גג(ו)ת על Jer 19:13 ; 32:29 , הלבנים על Isa 65:3 , ההרים על 65:7 ; with לְ of deity, Hosea 11:2 ; Jer 1:16 14 t. Jeremiah (+ 19:13 ; 32:29 above), Hab 1:16 ; 2Kin 22:17 ; 23:5 ; 2Chr 25:14 ; 28:25 ; 34:25 Qr (&gt;Kt Hiph`il ), to the brazen serpent 2Kin 18:4 . Pu`al Participle וגו מֹר ׳מְקֻטֶּרֶת Song 3:6 fumigated with myrrh , etc. (Aq ᵑ9 Schlottm מִקְּטֹרֶת ). Hiph`il n Perfect 3masculine singular הִקְטִיר Lev 9:10 +; 2 masculine singular הִקְטַרְתָּ Exod 29:13 , 18 , 25 , etc.; Imperfect 3masculine singular יַקְטִיר Lev 4:26 ; 16:25 ; Exod 40:27 +, etc.: Imperative masculine singular הַקְטֵר 2Kin 16:15 ; Infinitive absolute הַקְטֵיר 1Kin 9:25 ; construct לְהַקְטִיר Exod 30:20 +; Participle מַקְטִיר Jer 33:18 +, etc. 1 make sacrifices smoke , usually a. in worship of ׳י : absolute 1Kin 12:33 ; 13:1 ; 2Chr 29:11 ; with accusative חלב Lev 17:6 ; Num 18:17 ; 1Sam 2:15-16 , עלת 2Kin 16:13 , 15 ; 2Chr 13:11 , אִשֶּׁה Exod 30:20 ; Lev 2:11 ; Num 18:17 , מנחה Jer 33:18 ; ראֹשׁ , etc., Lev 8:20 אַזְכָּרָה 2:16 , השׁלמים חלבי 6:5 ; קטרת 1Sam 2:28 ; on 1Kin 9:25 see Klo Benz; place is מזבח על Lev 4:10 5 t., הַמִוְבֵּ֫חָה Exod 29:13 , 18 , 25 23 t. Leviticus, Num 5:26 (all P); with הַמִּזְבֵּחַ (accusative) Lev 6:8 ; בַּבָּמוֺת 1Kin 3:3 ; הִנֹּם בן בגיא 2Chr 28:3 . b. less often in worship of other gods , לאלהין (gods of Solomon's wives) 1Kin 11:8 , לאלהיו (of Moab) Jer 48:35 , להם (Baalim) Hosea 2:15 ; &#8212; 2Chr 34:25 read Qr Qal. 2. cause incense to smoke, offer incense absolute 2Chr 2:5 ; 26:18 (twice in verse); 26:19 ; with עַל of altar 26:16 ; Exod 30:7 ; 40:27 ; with accusative יַקְטִירֶנָּה 30:7-8 , סמים קטרת 30:7 ; 40:27 ; 2Chr 2:3 , תמיד קטרת Exod 30:8 , ׳הק קטרת Num 17:5 ; 2Chr 29:7 . 3 make smoke upon ( על ) both altars (of burnt-offering and of incense) 1Chr 6:34 , compare also 23:13 . Hoph`al be made to smoke as a sacrifice: Imperfect 3feminine singular תָּקְטָ֑ר Lev 6:15 , Participle מֻקְטָר Mal 1:11 (Ew Ke and others [ Ges § 121b ]; We Now read ׳מ מִנְחָה לִשְׁמִי ; but see מֻקְטָר ). מֻקְטָר noun masculine incense ; — absolute ׳מ Mal 1:11 (Thes Hi Marti Kau GASm Kö iii, § 307 ). [ מְקַטֵּרָה ] noun feminine incense-alter ; — plural absolute מְקַטְּרוֺת 2Chr 30:14 .","rootNote":"a primitive root (identical with through the idea of fumigation in a close place and perhaps thus driving out the occupants);","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 6 34","keyReferences":["1Chr 6 34","1Chr 23 13","1Kgs 3 3","1Kgs 9 25","1Kgs 11 8","1Kgs 12 33","1Kgs 13 1","1Kgs 13 2"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":117,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 6 34","book":"1Chr","chapter":6,"verse":34,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מַקְטִירִ֨ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVhrmpa"},{"reference":"1Chr 23 13","book":"1Chr","chapter":23,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/הַקְטִיר֩","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Vhc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 3 3","book":"1Kgs","chapter":3,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/מַקְטִֽיר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vhrmsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 9 25","book":"1Kgs","chapter":9,"verse":25,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/הַקְטֵ֣יר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vha"},{"reference":"1Kgs 11 8","book":"1Kgs","chapter":11,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מַקְטִיר֥וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVhrfpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 12 33","book":"1Kgs","chapter":12,"verse":33,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/הַקְטִֽיר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Vhc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 13 1","book":"1Kgs","chapter":13,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/הַקְטִֽיר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Vhc"},{"r